        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>光明日报 2025年1月30日 第4版</title>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    background: #f5f5f0;\n    color: #222;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n  .newspaper {\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 15px 20px;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n  }\n  /* Masthead */\n  .masthead {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 10px 0 5px;\n    border-bottom: 3px double #c00;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .masthead-title {\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    font-size: 72px;\n    color: #c00;\n    letter-spacing: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  .masthead-en {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    letter-spacing: 8px;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .date-bar {\n    background: #1a5276;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 6px 15px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .date-bar span { margin: 0 10px; }\n  .pub-info {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #555;\n    padding: 3px 0 8px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  /* Main headline area */\n  .top-section {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 15px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .main-headline {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 10px 0;\n  }\n  .main-headline h1 {\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .main-headline h2 {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .main-headline .subtitle {\n  